[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0306","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0093","title":"Red Hat Linux 初始密码使用 DES 弱加密算法漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 在安装过程中默认使用 DES 加密算法配合 crypt() 函数对初始用户密码进行哈希处理，而非采用安全性更高的 MD5 算法。DES 算法密钥空间有限（56 位），易于被暴力破解或彩虹表攻击，攻击者在获取到 /etc/shadow 文件中的密码哈希后，可利用 DES 较弱的加密强度在较短时间内破解用户密码。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 多个版本，属于加密算法强度不足导致的敏感信息泄露风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0093"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59Z","remediation":"修改 /etc/login.defs 配置文件，将 ENCRYPT_METHOD 设为 MD5 或 SHA512（推荐 SHA512），并运行 authconfig --passalgo=sha512 --update 命令切换系统密码加密算法。同时使用 pwconv 命令重新加密现有用户口令。升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及以上版本可获得 md5 密码支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0093","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0093.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0093","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/922354cca15ef3923415d02f4397f929a0208531/2000/CVE-2000-0093.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0093.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jpmj-rq8m-mfq3/GHSA-jpmj-rq8m-mfq3.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0093.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88231/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0300","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0091","title":"Inter7 vpopmail（vchkpw）POP认证组件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Inter7 vpopmail 的 vchkpw POP 认证组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 POP3 服务发送超长用户名或密码参数触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 vpopmail 3.4.11 及更早版本，利用复杂度低，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0091"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58Z","remediation":"立即将 vpopmail 升级至 3.4.12 及以上版本，该版本已修复 vchkpw POP 认证模块中用户名/密码长度未校验导致的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可限制 POP3 服务的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信网段连接 110 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.inter7.com/vpopmail/","http://www.inter7.com/vpopmail/ChangeLog","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/942","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19727","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0091.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0091","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0091.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0091.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j7gx-8wqm-phgg/GHSA-j7gx-8wqm-phgg.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/pop3_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001112.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0091.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0098","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0115","title":"Microsoft IIS ASP Visual Basic Script 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 在处理 ASP 页面中的 VBScript 脚本时，未对用户提供的正则表达式进行充分校验，导致本地攻击者可通过构造特殊的非法正则表达式触发服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 IIS 服务器，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，利用方式简单，可导致 IIS 服务拒绝服务，影响网站正常访问。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0115"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01Z","remediation":"建议安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-008 对应的补丁（Q246018），或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。如暂无法打补丁，可在 IIS 管理控制台中将 ASP 脚本超时时间由默认 90 秒下调至 30 秒，并在「应用程序配置-调试」中关闭「启用 ASP 服务器端脚本调试」，以降低恶意正则导致的资源耗尽风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94881904724731&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0115.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0115","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/edba2e8a11daaad31ff57bea0f9419186eb54326/2000/CVE-2000-0115.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0115.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f70e6a601722304a9bfb028d474ddc908ac9d9b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5pfw-hvfc-h744/GHSA-5pfw-hvfc-h744.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0115.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88274/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001114.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0073","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0088","title":"Microsoft Office Word 5 文档格式转换器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 系列产品（Word、PowerPoint 等）中的日文、韩文和中文 Word 5 文档格式转换工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户使用受影响的 Office 版本打开特制的畸形文档数据时，转换程序在处理畸形转换数据时触发缓冲区溢出，攻击者可利用该漏洞执行任意代码。攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意文档方可利用，影响范围包括 Office 2000 及早期版本。微软已发布安全公告和补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0088"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58Z","remediation":"建议受影响的日文、韩文、简体/繁体中文版 Microsoft Office 97/2000（Word 97/98/2000、PowerPoint 97/2000）及 Office Converter Pack 2000 用户立即安装 MS00-002 公告提供的专用补丁，分别从对应区域的 Office Update 网站下载 Word 5 转换器更新包。若无法立即打补丁，应避免打开来路不明的东亚语言 Word 5 文档，并在注册表中禁用 Word 5 文档格式转换器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/946","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-002","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0088.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0088","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0088.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0088.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v953-3rp8-5v5v/GHSA-v953-3rp8-5v5v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c0675c79-afb8-42ff-adb6-ddd71d517e29.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0088.json","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/e1fa268f46af70c043d8fa3850aa13f3adaa5831/advisories/2022/04/EUVD-2000-0087.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0076","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0092","title":"BSD make 竞争条件漏洞","description":"BSD make 程序在处理 -j 并行编译选项时存在符号链接竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录下创建恶意符号链接，利用 make 程序在临时文件操作过程中的时间窗口，诱导程序向任意系统文件写入数据，从而导致权限提升或文件内容篡改。该漏洞影响多个 BSD 系统及衍生版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0092"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59Z","remediation":"升级 BSD make 至 1.x 以上版本（该漏洞已在后续版本修复），或改用 GNU Make 替代以避免 /tmp 竞争条件。临时缓解措施：避免在全局可写目录下以 -j 参数执行 make，并确保 make 工作目录的 sticky bit 已设置（chmod +t /tmp）。","status":"completed","colle