6-06-16T21:50:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 UnixWare 至最新补丁级别，或安装 SCO 针对此漏洞发布的安全补丁。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod 0755 /usr/bin/ppptalk` 移除 setuid 位，阻止普通用户提权；同时通过 `chmod 750` 限制 ppptalk 仅授信管理员可执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94848865112897&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0099.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0099","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0099.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0099.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b029cc6cdc62926be1ff123d5ca2faba44641d8e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h7wm-7j5h-gr2f/GHSA-h7wm-7j5h-gr2f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83017/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0099.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/158dea8303c58859521e12d6c7ff455ac536c21d/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0071","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0071.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0086","title":"Netopia Timbuktu Pro 明文传送用户凭证漏洞","description":"Netopia Timbuktu Pro 在用户认证过程中以明文方式传输用户名和口令，攻击者通过在网络链路上进行嗅探即可被动捕获这些敏感凭据信息。该漏洞允许同一网络段上的未授权攻击者获取合法用户的登录凭证，进而远程登录目标系统执行任意操作。该漏洞影响 Netopia Timbuktu Pro 系列版本，危害等级中危，需升级至修复版本或启用加密通信机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0086"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58Z","remediation":"升级 Netopia Timbuktu Pro 至支持加密认证的版本（Timbuktu Pro 6.0 及以上版本已修复此问题）；如无法升级，应将所有 Timbuktu 通信流量强制通过 VPN 或 SSH 隧道传输以防止中间人嗅探；对于已停止支持的旧版本，建议迁移至支持全流量加密的现代远程管理方案（如 SSH/RDP/TeamViewer 等），同时可设置防火墙规则限制 Timbuktu 端口的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/935","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0086.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0086","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0086.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0086.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jf26-w6c3-33f6/GHSA-jf26-w6c3-33f6.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0086.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--4a8779f7-9a97-4dfb-9538-73149fc65256.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0071.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0065","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0079","title":"W3C CERN httpd 路径泄露漏洞","description":"W3C CERN httpd（原 CERN httpd）HTTP 服务器存在路径泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的不存在的 URL 请求，从错误响应中获取服务器上命令的真实路径信息。该漏洞可导致敏感目录结构暴露，为后续攻击提供信息支撑，影响运行 W3C httpd 服务的系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0079"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:57Z","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 CERN httpd(W3C httpd)，迁移至 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.x 或 Nginx 等现代活跃维护的 Web 服务器。迁移后需正确配置错误页面响应，禁用 ServerTokens 及 ServerSignature 等服务器信息泄露选项，避免将内部路径暴露给客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/936","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad6ba3d27513a57837704589c10c0be969a18efd/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0079.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0079","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0079.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d32b25dbea4bacedc1131a8702fa8adcc181eee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0079.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/cern_httpd_path.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0079.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001106.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d897b503-e58e-4a56-9502-1a3171f63863.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/cern_httpd_path.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0065.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0065.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0206","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0065","title":"A-V Tronics InetServ 3.0 WebMail 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"A-V Tronics InetServ 3.0 WebMail 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的超长 GET 请求触发该漏洞，导致拒绝服务或任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 InetServ 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，仅需构造并发送特定长度的 HTTP GET 请求即可触发溢出。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0065"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:55Z","remediation":"InetServ 3.0 已停止维护，厂商未发布补丁。建议立即迁移至有安全支持的替代邮件服务产品。如无法立即替换，可在网络边界防火墙上限制仅信任 IP 访问 WebMail 端口（默认 TCP 80/8080），同时在前置反向代理（如 Nginx）中配置请求 URI 长度限制（如 client_header_buffer_size 4k）以拦截超长 GET 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0065","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19730","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0065.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0065.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/919d6cac5eadae13826d4a35bab84cf2bac57965/2000/CVE-2000-0065.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-0065.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0065.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CV